{
  "_notes": [
    "Heavy Metal Meltdown / Black Belt / City Slicker / Dungeon & Dragons / Hardbody /",
    "Party Animal / Special Force / Strange Science high score decoder family.",
    "Decoder constants are one-based file offsets; scores use the high nibble of seven",
    "little-endian score bytes.",
    "",
    "This family stores FOUR independent high scores (not one as the sibling eballchp",
    "family does). Each score occupies 7 consecutive bytes at +7 intervals from 0x0618.",
    "Initials occupy 3 bytes each at +3 intervals from 0x06C3."
